  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Data and codes pertaining to the manuscript \"Rapid Homotopic Communication Between Human Orbitofrontal Subregions\" by Starkweather et al. This is a cortico-cortical evoked potential mapping study. This uploaded data contains preprocessed data timeseries (condensed_ecog_OFC_only.mat) with each item within the structure referring to an individual electrode. condensed_ecog(eRec).bipolar refers to the bipolar referenced data from electrode eRec, and condensed_eocg(eRec).lat_coor corresponds to the medial/lateral distance from the lateral orbital sulcus. The critical data analysis summary (Figure 3a) contained in the manuscript was obtained by first running automate_stim_metadata_collection_zscores.m, followed by CCEP_multiplearrays_multiplesubjects_zscores</p>",
